WEBVTT

00:01.190 --> 00:03.090
Ah! Haruto!

00:03.350 --> 00:05.820
I found some people who look suspicious!

00:06.380 --> 00:10.580
<i>Char's really taken to these patrols.</i>

00:10.580 --> 00:12.720
<i>As a result, I've been downright swamped.</i>

00:12.720 --> 00:14.270
Master!

00:14.270 --> 00:17.540
The young lady told me you've 
been going off by yourself,

00:17.540 --> 00:18.820
so I came running back!

00:18.820 --> 00:21.800
Please let me join you on these missions!

00:22.070 --> 00:23.910
Flay, thanks for your hard work!

00:23.790 --> 00:26.000
<b>Ugh,
she's here to turn this into a headache</b>

00:23.910 --> 00:25.990
<i>Ugh, she's here to turn 
this into a headache.</i>

00:26.340 --> 00:28.460
I thought you were too busy.

00:28.460 --> 00:30.010
Not a problem!

00:30.010 --> 00:34.940
I've finished all my yard work and 
monster subjugation tasks for the day!

00:34.940 --> 00:37.850
<i>Ah, she's done everything I asked her to.</i>

00:37.850 --> 00:39.300
Could it be?!

00:39.300 --> 00:41.900
Flay, are you going to 
join forces with him?!

00:43.630 --> 00:48.330
In every story, when the hero is in trouble, 
his partner comes to save the day.

00:48.660 --> 00:51.450
And that partner was Flay all along!

00:51.710 --> 00:53.160
Exactly!

00:53.160 --> 00:55.030
I may come up short compared to my master,

00:55.030 --> 00:58.950
but everyone knows that 
I can still be of help!

00:58.950 --> 01:00.360
<i>Don't you play along with her!</i>

01:00.570 --> 01:01.740
Haruto!

01:01.740 --> 01:02.930
My master!

01:04.010 --> 01:05.660
<i>Whatta pain!</i>

01:04.080 --> 01:06.000
<b>Whatta pain</b>

01:07.340 --> 01:08.970
Listen up, Flay.

01:08.970 --> 01:12.010
No graphic violence while Char is watching.

01:12.010 --> 01:12.920
Got it?

01:12.920 --> 01:13.720
Yes!

01:13.720 --> 01:14.970
I mean it!

01:14.970 --> 01:15.990
Understood!

01:20.270 --> 01:23.160
Heh, just check out this haul!

01:23.160 --> 01:26.630
We'll be eating real good for a while!

01:26.630 --> 01:27.710
You there!

01:27.710 --> 01:29.360
What, exactly, are you up to?!

01:29.360 --> 01:31.410
Wh-Who goes there?!

01:33.730 --> 01:37.080
They call me darker than darkness...

01:37.690 --> 01:40.480
The Black Knight has arrived!

01:41.990 --> 01:44.080
Th-The Black Knight?!

01:44.820 --> 01:47.540
They call me redder than redness...

01:48.030 --> 01:51.250
I am the Crimson Knight!

01:51.570 --> 01:53.460
Flame Fenrir!

01:54.040 --> 01:56.630
Wh-Who in the world are you?!

01:56.630 --> 02:00.980
I'm about to reduce every 
one of you to cinders!

02:00.980 --> 02:02.140
Take this!

02:02.140 --> 02:03.190
<i>Hold your horses!</i>

02:03.190 --> 02:04.810
<i>Were you even listening to me?!</i>

02:04.810 --> 02:07.410
Hot, hot, hot!

02:07.410 --> 02:09.690
<i>Hey, now! They're gonna burn up!</i>

02:09.690 --> 02:11.400
Flay! Stay!

02:12.810 --> 02:14.400
Burn!

02:14.400 --> 02:15.570
Stay!

02:21.840 --> 02:23.660
It's not working?!

02:23.660 --> 02:26.700
How about this, then?!

02:27.450 --> 02:29.160
Stay!

02:29.510 --> 02:32.590
Didn't I tell you no graphic violence?!

02:32.900 --> 02:38.480
I remember, but anyone who gets in 
the way of my master is my enemy!

02:38.480 --> 02:40.220
<i>She doesn't get it at all!</i>

02:41.970 --> 02:44.310
<i>I'm sick of this birdbrain!</i>

02:44.590 --> 02:45.820
Stay, stay.

02:47.030 --> 02:48.580
You've done enough.

02:48.580 --> 02:50.500
I'll deal the final blow.

02:50.500 --> 02:51.530
Can you head back first?

02:51.880 --> 02:54.640
I see. How kind of you, Master.

02:55.170 --> 02:57.100
I'll be here to see it through.

02:57.330 --> 02:58.210
<i>Leave already.</i>

03:02.570 --> 03:04.530
<b>Tired...</b>

03:04.530 --> 03:07.960
Haruto and Flay, you were both so awesome!

03:09.010 --> 03:11.910
It was like I was watching a manzai routine!

03:11.910 --> 03:13.670
<i>What? Manzai?</i>

03:14.030 --> 03:18.240
Still... I was attacking at my full power...

03:18.240 --> 03:22.370
but something got in my way, 
so I couldn't be of use.

03:22.720 --> 03:25.050
However, next time for sure!

03:25.050 --> 03:27.260
<i>Seriously, there'll be no next time.</i>

03:27.590 --> 03:31.290
I can't wait to see more of your manzai!

03:31.290 --> 03:32.560
<i>Wait, that part?!</i>

03:33.670 --> 03:36.210
<i>Seeing Char look so happy</i>

03:36.210 --> 03:38.150
<i>makes me wanna keep working with Flay!</i>

03:38.150 --> 03:39.770
<i>As if! Not happening!</i>

03:40.040 --> 03:43.180
Flay, your finishing pose 
should be like this!

03:43.180 --> 03:44.370
Like this?

03:46.260 --> 03:50.860
<i>When will I be able to live out 
a peaceful life as a recluse?</i>

04:10.470 --> 04:13.850
<b>Am I Actually the Strongest?</b>

05:22.210 --> 05:28.210
m 0 0 l 50 0 l 45 13 l -5 13

05:22.210 --> 05:28.210
Episode 4

05:22.210 --> 05:28.210
<b>I Flip My Lid</b>

05:23.170 --> 05:24.590
Damn it!

05:24.590 --> 05:25.930
How did it end up this way?!

05:26.270 --> 05:27.900
I'm the prince!

05:27.900 --> 05:31.100
The progeny of the Flash Princess, 
next in line to be king!

05:31.100 --> 05:33.560
I was going to make sure 
he understood that...

05:34.210 --> 05:38.090
I thought he was supposed 
to be a worthless level 2!

05:39.770 --> 05:42.430
Your Highness, if I may intrude.

05:42.430 --> 05:43.500
You may enter.

05:45.480 --> 05:47.950
It's almost time for the banquet.

05:51.100 --> 05:55.710
For tomorrow's tour, please ask 
Lady Charlotte to join you.

05:55.710 --> 05:58.260
Huh? Why a pipsqueak like her?

05:58.650 --> 06:01.200
I thought you might enjoy her company.

06:01.970 --> 06:04.050
There's no need for that!

06:04.050 --> 06:05.010
Your Highness.

06:05.860 --> 06:09.530
This is for Your Highness's sake.

06:09.530 --> 06:11.580
Please do as I say.

06:14.380 --> 06:15.650
Fine, then.

06:19.130 --> 06:22.490
Haruto, the banquet is over!

06:23.880 --> 06:26.910
Sorry, I forgot to knock!

06:27.360 --> 06:29.090
Yeah, you did.

06:30.250 --> 06:34.950
Oh! The food's as fancy as I imagined.

06:35.750 --> 06:36.950
Huh? What?

06:37.400 --> 06:41.130
You've got some nerve making 
me go to that banquet.

06:41.490 --> 06:45.830
We're the same person, so you must 
know how miserable it was for me.

06:45.830 --> 06:48.210
Yeah, I wouldn't be able to handle it.

06:48.570 --> 06:50.670
I'm so damn sick of everything!

06:51.030 --> 06:53.590
Being forced to do all the 
stuff you don't want to do!

06:53.590 --> 06:56.110
Exactly what do I mean to you?!

06:59.640 --> 07:03.150
Is the other Haruto all right?

07:03.580 --> 07:06.810
At least I'll be there 
for the tour tomorrow...

07:07.070 --> 07:08.930
Huh? Why are you going, Char?

07:08.930 --> 07:11.420
The prince just invited me to come.

07:11.420 --> 07:12.660
Huh...

07:13.050 --> 07:15.690
<i>Wait, is he into little girls?</i>

07:19.880 --> 07:22.810
Fine, guess I'll go.

07:27.250 --> 07:31.030
<i>If Char's coming, I should 
cover all my bases.</i>

07:31.030 --> 07:33.250
<i>Let's check out the route for the tour.</i>

07:39.330 --> 07:40.840
Who are these guys?

07:41.530 --> 07:44.390
<i>Totally looks like they're 
summoning something.</i>

07:45.530 --> 07:47.830
<i>Guess I'll go and take a look.</i>

07:55.350 --> 07:57.490
Um... excuse me.

07:57.490 --> 07:59.780
What are you all doing here?

08:00.700 --> 08:02.580
Wh-Who are you?!

08:02.580 --> 08:05.120
Oh, I was just passing by.

08:05.120 --> 08:08.740
If you could just get approval 
from the margrave, Gold Zenfis...

08:08.740 --> 08:10.020
Why, you!

08:10.020 --> 08:11.850
You're one of the margrave's men?!

08:11.850 --> 08:13.210
Get rid of him!

08:13.210 --> 08:15.020
Make sure he doesn't escape!

08:16.410 --> 08:17.720
That's your answer?

08:18.400 --> 08:22.570
In that case, I won't 
show any mercy, either!

08:28.510 --> 08:32.870
We can't let ourselves be done in here...

08:33.190 --> 08:36.150
Come forth! Knight Skeletons!

08:38.770 --> 08:41.740
<i>Whoa! My first time seeing 
skeleton soldiers.</i>

08:42.160 --> 08:45.710
<i>They're cool in video games, 
but kinda freaky in real life.</i>

08:45.710 --> 08:48.060
Take him down!

08:55.500 --> 08:56.390
<i>Ah...</i>

08:57.540 --> 08:59.760
<i>Yep, saw that coming.</i>

08:59.760 --> 09:01.100
Keep going!

09:01.100 --> 09:02.940
Restrain his movements!

09:12.090 --> 09:14.930
<i>Hmm... this is gonna drag on forever.</i>

09:15.940 --> 09:20.360
<i>Wait, those red things in their chests...</i>

09:20.670 --> 09:22.300
One more time!

09:23.210 --> 09:24.630
What's wrong?

09:24.630 --> 09:26.520
What are you doing?!

09:34.350 --> 09:36.560
What's gotten into them?!

09:36.560 --> 09:38.470
I'm left with no choice!

09:38.470 --> 09:40.870
Come forth, golem!

09:48.510 --> 09:49.610
<i>Whoa!</i>

09:49.610 --> 09:51.600
<i>A real golem! It's so strong!</i>

09:51.600 --> 09:53.440
<i>It sure does pack a punch!</i>

10:01.330 --> 10:03.650
Yes! It's working!

10:03.650 --> 10:05.850
Smash him to smithereens!

10:05.850 --> 10:08.000
<i>That golem's no joke.</i>

10:08.000 --> 10:10.260
<i>My defense there was a bit too flimsy.</i>

10:10.850 --> 10:12.000
<i>Now, then...</i>

10:12.000 --> 10:13.910
<i>How do I take care of this guy?</i>

10:15.210 --> 10:15.940
<i>Hmm?</i>

10:16.670 --> 10:20.910
<i>On closer inspection, there's something 
in the golem's chest, as well.</i>

10:40.070 --> 10:41.230
What?!

10:41.230 --> 10:43.280
It suddenly stopped moving!

10:43.580 --> 10:44.920
Hey, move!

10:44.920 --> 10:46.560
Move, I say!

10:54.790 --> 10:57.560
Why is it suddenly attacking us?!

10:57.560 --> 10:58.960
Oh, I'm sorry.

10:58.960 --> 11:00.490
It's probably my fault.

11:00.490 --> 11:01.520
What?!

11:01.520 --> 11:06.080
I was trying to stop it in its tracks, 
so I drove in a stake-shaped barrier,

11:06.080 --> 11:08.810
but it looks like I changed 
it to use my magic formula.

11:08.810 --> 11:12.350
What?! You overrode its magic formula?!

11:12.350 --> 11:14.740
Well, that's really what happened, so...

11:15.190 --> 11:17.290
Um, excuse me.

11:17.290 --> 11:19.900
Which one of you is the leader here?

11:27.560 --> 11:30.480
Tell me your name and your affiliation.

11:33.220 --> 11:34.670
Why did you come here?

11:37.290 --> 11:40.550
Wait, am I overstepping my boundaries?

11:40.550 --> 11:42.560
I'm not good at talking to people.

11:43.630 --> 11:46.720
Hmm, what to do...

11:46.720 --> 11:47.630
All right, then.

11:54.000 --> 11:56.770
H-Help!

11:57.060 --> 11:58.620
Captain!

11:58.620 --> 12:03.060
Be buried alive like this, 
or tell me the truth.

11:59.970 --> 12:01.710
Help us!

12:02.360 --> 12:04.090
Stop it!

12:03.060 --> 12:04.580
Pick one.

12:04.580 --> 12:06.900
Captain!

12:06.900 --> 12:09.810
Don't bury us!

12:09.810 --> 12:15.220
I-I'm with the Queen Consort's 
personal Summoner Unit!

12:15.580 --> 12:18.500
We were making preparations,

12:18.500 --> 12:22.870
so that we could attack tomorrow's party for 
the farmland tour with summoned beasts!

12:23.290 --> 12:24.510
The Queen Consort?

12:24.510 --> 12:26.160
Our kingdom's?

12:26.770 --> 12:27.550
Why?

12:29.970 --> 12:31.600
What are you after?

12:32.040 --> 12:34.450
O-Our goal...

12:34.450 --> 12:37.970
is to assassinate Charlotte Zenfis!

12:38.470 --> 12:39.580
What?

12:42.030 --> 12:44.270
Why would the Queen Consort...

12:44.270 --> 12:46.400
be after Charlotte's life?

12:46.680 --> 12:50.750
Her magical aptitude will surpass 
even the Queen Consort's some day...

12:50.750 --> 12:53.910
The fear was that if she had 
the backing of the margrave,

12:53.910 --> 12:56.740
the kingdom would eventually 
be split into two.

12:56.740 --> 13:01.940
Previously, we were using imperial 
soldiers, but they failed us twice,

13:01.940 --> 13:05.210
which is why the Queen Consort 
sent us, her own personal unit.

13:06.680 --> 13:08.060
Hold on a minute.

13:08.700 --> 13:12.300
<i>Using imperial soldiers to attack Dad,</i>

13:13.000 --> 13:15.510
<i>as well as the attempt on 
Mom and Char's lives...</i>

13:15.980 --> 13:19.240
<i>It was all that woman's doing?!</i>

13:21.570 --> 13:23.780
<i>Oh, I see now.</i>

13:24.750 --> 13:28.880
<i>It was the same when 
she abandoned me, wasn't it?</i>

13:29.300 --> 13:34.090
<i>That woman would resort to anything 
to protect her own status.</i>

13:36.510 --> 13:38.190
She'll pay for this.

13:48.740 --> 13:49.790
Stop.

13:53.140 --> 13:56.190
<i>I was almost about to let it run berserk.</i>

13:58.030 --> 14:02.670
<i>I won't let anyone take 
away the people I love.</i>

14:04.060 --> 14:07.410
<i>Even if that person is my biological mother.</i>

14:09.470 --> 14:11.200
<i>Now, then...</i>

14:12.380 --> 14:14.160
<i>how should I deal with her?</i>

14:18.540 --> 14:19.960
<b>Am I Actually the Strongest?</b>

14:32.060 --> 14:37.550
Prince Laius, don't be sad 
about losing to Haruto.

14:37.550 --> 14:40.260
You never stood a chance of winning!

14:41.100 --> 14:45.200
In fact, you should be proud you 
even challenged him to a duel!

14:46.140 --> 14:47.580
That's right.

14:47.580 --> 14:49.860
Besides, there's no shame in losing.

14:51.490 --> 14:53.650
Let's leave it at that, you two.

14:53.650 --> 14:56.250
You're the one person I 
don't want any pity from!

14:56.250 --> 15:00.290
Also, you didn't use any magic back then!

15:00.290 --> 15:02.090
What in the world did you do?!

15:02.090 --> 15:06.620
I can perform self-augmentation if I tell 
myself something like, "Get nice and strong!"

15:08.640 --> 15:10.390
Are you serious?!

15:08.640 --> 15:10.390
Seriously?!

15:10.390 --> 15:12.460
<i>Huh? That's weird.</i>

15:12.460 --> 15:15.700
<i>Mom and Dad seemed just fine 
when I explained it like that...</i>

15:15.700 --> 15:17.810
That's amazing, Haruto!

15:19.200 --> 15:22.890
Wait, are you a returned demon?

15:22.890 --> 15:23.700
Laius!

15:24.070 --> 15:27.640
I mean, it doesn't make any sense otherwise!

15:28.030 --> 15:29.860
What's a returned demon?

15:29.860 --> 15:32.540
When a demon marries a human,

15:32.540 --> 15:35.990
their descendants can show 
demonic traits in rare cases.

15:36.270 --> 15:40.870
It's true that returned demons display 
extraordinary physical abilities,

15:40.870 --> 15:43.960
as well as high mana stores.

15:44.720 --> 15:46.540
But I don't see any horns.

15:46.540 --> 15:49.500
And his ears and eyes look 
normal, so I don't think...

15:49.500 --> 15:53.170
Haruto's skin is smooth and shiny.

15:53.170 --> 15:53.740
Huh?

15:54.150 --> 15:58.550
I say this as someone who's bathed 
with him, so you can rest assured!

15:58.550 --> 15:59.530
What?!

16:00.910 --> 16:04.060
Y-Y-You take baths with your sister?!

16:04.060 --> 16:06.150
H-H-Have some shame!

16:06.150 --> 16:09.560
<i>I will point out that it wasn't my idea!</i>

16:09.930 --> 16:12.160
Is there something wrong with that?

16:12.160 --> 16:15.070
Huh? I wouldn't go that far...

16:15.070 --> 16:17.490
It's more like, it's really not done...

16:18.670 --> 16:24.790
A-Also, it's special when a man and woman 
get naked in front of each other...

16:25.060 --> 16:30.380
A dignified act to propagate offspring...

16:27.610 --> 16:30.380
<i><i>Wait, just calm down, Marianne!</i></i>

16:32.580 --> 16:33.830
Looks like we're here.

16:41.710 --> 16:43.640
What a splendid wheat field.

16:44.130 --> 16:45.520
<i>Huh...</i>

16:45.520 --> 16:48.110
<i>I've never seen a wheat field before.</i>

16:48.110 --> 16:50.180
<i>Japan's full of paddy fields instead.</i>

16:50.180 --> 16:51.480
That's amazing!

16:51.480 --> 16:54.100
There's so much grass growing in the field!

16:54.100 --> 16:57.210
Marianne, let's go take a closer look!

16:57.210 --> 16:59.420
Ah! Charlotte!

16:59.420 --> 17:01.400
It's dangerous to run like that!

17:15.220 --> 17:17.220
Dad, do you have a second?

17:17.650 --> 17:19.390
What is it, Haruto?

17:19.390 --> 17:22.300
I just had a few questions.

17:28.490 --> 17:31.700
It's not often that you come to me.

17:31.700 --> 17:34.200
It must be something important.

17:35.250 --> 17:38.930
Well... This is purely hypothetical.

17:40.040 --> 17:44.000
What would you do if the 
Queen Consort were after Char's life?

17:45.630 --> 17:49.460
Oh, uh, sorry for asking 
such a weird question.

17:49.460 --> 17:53.600
No, it looks like you sense 
that something is happening.

17:54.170 --> 17:58.070
Last night, I received another 
letter from the Black Knight.

17:58.550 --> 18:00.750
When I followed his instructions,

18:00.750 --> 18:03.690
I found the Queen Consort's 
hand-picked magicians, passed out.

18:04.030 --> 18:10.640
I knew she regarded me as an enemy, 
but to think she was after Charlotte...

18:10.940 --> 18:14.540
That woman's aim is to 
obliterate us completely.

18:14.540 --> 18:16.450
But she's the Queen Consort.

18:16.450 --> 18:18.750
There's no way for us to retaliate.

18:19.280 --> 18:23.720
I wish a cruel queen like 
her would just go away.

18:27.510 --> 18:29.680
Be careful what you wish for.

18:30.170 --> 18:34.420
It's also the case that without her, 
the royal capital would be in turmoil.

18:34.420 --> 18:36.360
Huh? Why's that?

18:37.320 --> 18:43.040
It's a sad tale, but King Jilq 
fell from power long ago.

18:43.720 --> 18:47.710
There are many nobles who would 
try and usurp the throne.

18:47.710 --> 18:52.410
They're kept in check because the 
Queen Consort reigns supreme.

18:53.140 --> 18:57.730
<i>In other words, if she died, 
it would spark a civil war.</i>

18:58.170 --> 19:00.040
Two years before you were born...

19:00.710 --> 19:05.330
An army led by the king was formed 
to vanquish the Demon King.

19:05.330 --> 19:07.540
Among them was Gizelotte.

19:07.950 --> 19:12.150
Single-handedly, she took 
the Demon King's head off.

19:12.810 --> 19:17.710
Gizelotte was hailed as a hero, 
and became known as the Flash Princess.

19:18.110 --> 19:23.760
Afterwards, she entered marriage with the 
king, strongly supported by the citizens,

19:23.760 --> 19:26.310
and grew even more in popularity.

19:26.860 --> 19:31.670
And now, the Flash Princess is trying 
to take the kingdom for herself.

19:33.600 --> 19:36.190
<i>I didn't realize she was so influential.</i>

19:36.630 --> 19:40.140
<i>I wanted nothing to do with my parents, 
so I didn't do any research,</i>

19:40.140 --> 19:41.560
<i>but that was a mistake.</i>

19:41.860 --> 19:45.640
Well, if someone powerful showed 
up to replace the Queen Consort,

19:45.640 --> 19:47.300
that'd be another matter.

19:47.670 --> 19:50.820
In that case, why don't 
you become king, Dad?

19:51.210 --> 19:53.820
I don't know anything about politics.

19:53.820 --> 19:55.670
I wouldn't be cut out for it.

19:56.840 --> 19:59.200
But, well...

20:00.060 --> 20:03.910
There is one person, but she's still too young.

20:03.910 --> 20:06.320
I want to wait until she's 
an adult, at least.

20:07.450 --> 20:08.820
She's a clever girl.

20:08.820 --> 20:12.600
I'm sure she'll grow to be exceptional 
enough to lead the kingdom one day.

20:13.110 --> 20:14.930
<i>You mean Charlotte?!</i>

20:15.430 --> 20:18.010
What's more, she has unfathomable abilities.

20:18.010 --> 20:20.750
I don't think she realizes it herself,

20:20.750 --> 20:24.040
but I think she'll easily surpass the 
Flash Princess in magical power.

20:24.040 --> 20:28.590
<i>Oh, yeah, that guy said she has enough 
aptitude to surpass the Queen Consort.</i>

20:28.590 --> 20:33.290
After hearing all of this, you know 
exactly what I expect from you, right?

20:33.670 --> 20:34.510
Yeah.

20:35.050 --> 20:36.260
Will you do it?

20:36.910 --> 20:39.020
Yeah, of course.

20:41.270 --> 20:46.250
<i>What I need to do is keep Char safe 
until she grows to be a fine queen.</i>

20:46.690 --> 20:53.030
<i>Once I do that, I can rest easy and enjoy 
life as a shut-in here in this fantasy world.</i>

20:55.260 --> 20:59.910
Lord Haruto, let me bring you 
the Queen Consort's head.

21:00.230 --> 21:02.600
I will avenge my master for his past life.

21:02.600 --> 21:03.690
No.

21:03.690 --> 21:07.280
Sorry, but this is between me and her.

21:07.280 --> 21:10.410
It won't mean anything unless 
I kill her with my own hands.

21:10.410 --> 21:11.690
I see.

21:11.690 --> 21:13.580
How becoming of you, Lord Haruto.

21:13.580 --> 21:17.600
I would be honored to witness 
it when the time comes.

21:17.600 --> 21:18.450
Yeah.

21:21.530 --> 21:25.330
<i>That woman will come 
meddling again for sure.</i>

21:25.650 --> 21:28.090
<i>I can't just think about protecting Char.</i>

21:33.090 --> 21:37.280
<i>Well then, maybe it's time for a mother-son 
reunion, for the first time in a decade.</i>

